1
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,100
Ringu

2
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:57,100
Nanako Matsushima

3
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:00,600
Miki Nakatani

4
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,200
Hiroyuki Sanada

5
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:07,700
Based on the novel The Ring by Koji Suzuki

6
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:11,200
Screenplay by Hiroshi Takahashi

7
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:16,300
Directed by Hideo Nakata

8
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:35,400
Sunday , September 5

9
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:42,100
A grade-school boy took a trip to Izu with his family , and they stayed in a cabin .

10
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:45,400
He wanted to go out and play ...

11
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:48,400
but there was a TV show he didn 't want to miss .

12
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:52,200
So he recorded it on the VCR in their room .

13
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:55,100
But the channels down there are different from Tokyo 's .

14
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:59,000
No station there uses that channel , so nothing should 've been recorded .

15
00:01:59,300 --> 00:02:03,300
But when he played it back at home , a woman appeared on the screen and said :

16
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:07,100
" You will die in one week . "

17
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:10,300
The kid stopped the tape , and then the phone rang .

18
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,100
" You saw it . "

19
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:16,100
And the kid died a week later !

20
00:02:27,100 --> 00:02:28,800
What 's wrong , Tomoko ?

21
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,600
Who told you that story ?

22
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,900
- Everybody 's talking about it . - Was it Yoko ?

23
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:39,600
No , not her .

24
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:44,700
What ?

25
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:52,700
I saw a weird video the other day .

26
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:56,300
Where ?

27
00:02:57,700 --> 00:02:59,100
With Yoko and the others .

28
00:02:59,100 --> 00:03:02,500
is it true that you all went on a trip somewhere ?

29
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,200
Nothing happened !

30
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,300
But that night ...

31
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:20,500
Iwata found this weird video , and we all watched it .

32
00:03:24,900 --> 00:03:26,600
What was it like ?

33
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,000
it 's hard to say .

34
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,100
As soon as it ended , the phone rang .

35
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:40,800
But nobody was there .

36
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,100
Scary .

37
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:56,700
Everyone else had heard that story .

38
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,700
Today will be one week .

39
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:12,300
Come on !

40
00:04:14,300 --> 00:04:16,600
You 're just trying to scare me !

41
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,500
How did you know ?

42
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,700
I can 't believe it !

43
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,500
You 're so easy to fool .

44
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,400
But did you really spend the night there with Iwata ?

45
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:35,700
- So what happened ? - I 'm not telling !

46
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:37,600
- Confess ! - it 's a secret .

47
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,100
It was true , wasn 't it ?

48
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,300
Masami !

49
00:05:29,900 --> 00:05:31,200
Masami !

50
00:05:47,300 --> 00:05:48,400
Hello ?

51
00:05:52,900 --> 00:05:54,400
Hold on a sec .

52
00:05:57,900 --> 00:05:59,000
Hello ?

53
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:05,700
it 's you , Mom !

54
00:06:09,500 --> 00:06:11,200
A friend came over .

55
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,200
Okay .

56
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,800
Got it .

57
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:17,000
All right , all right .

58
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,200
Extra innings . They 'll be late .

59
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:31,300
My parents shouldn 't have scared me like that !

60
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:34,800
Look who 's talking . I 'm going to tell everyone tomorrow .

61
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:40,100
I 'm going to the bathroom . Don 't go upstairs without me .

62
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,200
Sure .

63
00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:16,200
On the mound , Takasu , the third player ... .

64
00:07:56,900 --> 00:08:00,200
Everyone 's talking about this deadly video ... .

65
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:01,600
Yes .

66
00:08:01,700 --> 00:08:04,600
- Have you heard what 's on it ? - Yes .

67
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:09,400
- Don 't look at the camera . - Sorry .

68
00:08:09,500 --> 00:08:10,700
One more time .

69
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,800
Have you heard what the video is like ?

70
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:19,800
I heard that suddenly there 's this scary woman ...

71
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:23,300
who says , " You will die in one week . "

72
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:26,200
They say she appears when you watch late-night shows on TV .

73
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:29,000
And then the phone rings .

74
00:08:30,100 --> 00:08:32,700
Late-night shows on TV ? What channel ?

75
00:08:33,100 --> 00:08:36,900
I heard it was on a local channel down in Izu .

76
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,700
- Izu ? - Yeah .

77
00:08:39,700 --> 00:08:43,100
And is there really anyone who died a week later ?

78
00:08:43,800 --> 00:08:46,300
No one that we know .

79
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,300
Well ... .

80
00:08:51,300 --> 00:08:52,400
What ?

81
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:55,700
A high school student I know told me ...

82
00:08:55,900 --> 00:09:00,200
a girl who watched it died in a car on a date with her boyfriend .

83
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:05,100
- An accident ? - No . They were found dead in a parked car .

84
00:09:05,500 --> 00:09:07,400
He watched the video , too .

85
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:10,600
it was in the paper a few days ago .

86
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,600
Do you know which high school she went to ?

87
00:09:14,700 --> 00:09:19,000
No . My friend heard it from a friend of hers .

88
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,400
- Ms . Asakawa . - Yes ?

89
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:26,200
- Here . - Thanks .

90
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:32,100
About ten years ago ...

91
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:36,300
a star killed herself , and people saw her ghost on TV .

92
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:41,600
Yeah , but this time everyone mentions the Izu Peninsula for some reason .

93
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:44,300
Well , maybe that 's where this one started .

94
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:47,100
Where did the story start about the woman with torn lips ?

95
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,800
I think it was Gifu .

96
00:09:48,900 --> 00:09:52,300
There was a big traffic accident there and that 's how it started .

97
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:54,000
A big accident ?

98
00:09:54,100 --> 00:09:58,700
These stories get started when people die horrible deaths .

99
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:02,900
- Did something happen in Izu then ? - l don 't know . Well , I have to go .

100
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:05,100
- Good night . - Good night .

101
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:29,700
Young Couple Found Dead in Car

102
00:10:33,100 --> 00:10:35,800
A 19-year-old Tokyo boy and a 1 7-year-old Yokohama girl ...

103
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:38,600
were found dead in a car on the morning of Sept . 6

104
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:49,300
Take care of it , okay ?

105
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:53,700
I thought you were leaving early today .

106
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:56,600
- Okazaki , will you do something for me ? - Sure .

107
00:10:56,700 --> 00:10:59,100
Can you find out which high school she went to ?

108
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,400
No problem .

109
00:11:00,500 --> 00:11:02,500
- Call me when you find it . - Okay .

110
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:31,100
Yoichi !

111
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:36,500
Sorry I 'm late . You changed already !

112
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:38,600
I got your clothes ready , too .

113
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:40,600
Thanks . We need to hurry .

114
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:47,500
Did Grandpa call ?

115
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:48,900
No .

116
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:54,600
How come Tomoko died ?

117
00:11:57,500 --> 00:12:00,400
Probably some disease .

118
00:12:01,500 --> 00:12:02,800
Zip me up .

119
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:11,100
Do young people die , too ?

120
00:12:13,700 --> 00:12:15,600
Sometimes they get sick .

121
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:20,400
But don 't talk about that at Aunt Yoshiki 's , okay ?

122
00:12:20,400 --> 00:12:22,500
it 's too painful for her .

123
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:23,700
Yeah .

124
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:27,200
Tomoko used to play with you , didn 't she ?

125
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,100
Dad .

126
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,900
How 's sister ?

127
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:58,000
She 's lying down . Better leave her alone .

128
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,600
I 'll go help .

129
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,800
Yoichi , you come sit here .

130
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:27,600
Excuse me .

131
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:34,900
Reiko .

132
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:44,800
- Does anyone know how Tomoko died ? - No , I don 't .

133
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:47,000
But the police did an autopsy !

134
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:49,700
But there was no evidence of a crime .

135
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:52,200
People don 't just die like that .

136
00:13:52,300 --> 00:13:55,600
And they never opened the coffin . Isn 't that strange ?

137
00:15:01,500 --> 00:15:02,700
Yoichi .

138
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:07,200
Don 't play in this room .

139
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:18,900
- Let 's go downstairs . - Okay .

140
00:15:25,700 --> 00:15:27,900
- Go ahead . - Okay .

141
00:15:30,100 --> 00:15:31,200
Hello ?

142
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:33,000
It 's Okazaki .

143
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:36,900
I found the name of the high school .

144
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:41,900
Seikei Girls ' School in Yokohama .

145
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:45,000
Thank you .

146
00:15:54,100 --> 00:15:57,000
In Loving Memory - Seikei Girls ' School

147
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:03,600
Yoko died , too .

148
00:16:03,700 --> 00:16:06,600
Yeah , and Iwata , too ... .

149
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:11,800
Sorry to interrupt .

150
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:17,000
Was the girl who died in the car a friend of yours , too ?

151
00:16:22,500 --> 00:16:24,700
If there 's anything you know ... .

152
00:16:26,100 --> 00:16:28,100
All of them died on the same day .

153
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:32,100
Yoko and Tomoko . And Iwata had a motorcycle accident .

154
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:35,800
- They saw the video . - The video ?

155
00:16:36,300 --> 00:16:40,200
Yoko told us they 'd all seen this weird video .

156
00:16:41,100 --> 00:16:43,700
When it was over , they got a phone call .

157
00:16:45,100 --> 00:16:47,300
Tomoko saw it , too ? Where ?

158
00:16:49,400 --> 00:16:52,100
They all went and spent the night somewhere .

159
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:55,600
A girl was with Tomoko when she died .

160
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:59,200
She went insane and was hospitalized .

161
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:02,300
She never goes anywhere where there 's a TV .

162
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:12,100
The girl was Tsuji Yoko , 1 7 , a senior at Seikei Girls ' School .

163
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:16,700
The boy was Nomi Tadahiko , 19 , a Junior College student .

164
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:20,300
The car doors were locked .

165
00:17:45,100 --> 00:17:48,000
I 've never seen a corpse look like that .

166
00:17:48,100 --> 00:17:49,600
Cause of death ?

167
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:52,200
Unknown . Their hearts simply stopped .

168
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:54,700
Drugs ?

169
00:17:55,000 --> 00:17:57,700
Nothing in the autopsy .

170
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:08,700
They went up there to make out , then they suddenly died .

171
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:12,500
it doesn 't make any sense .

172
00:18:45,500 --> 00:18:48,000
I heard that Yoichi came to the funeral .

173
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:51,100
Yes .

174
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:55,700
He used to go upstairs and play in Tomoko 's room .

175
00:18:59,000 --> 00:19:00,600
He did .

176
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:02,300
Photo development receipt

177
00:20:13,700 --> 00:20:15,600
This is where l found Tomoko dead .

178
00:20:19,700 --> 00:20:20,800
Tomoko !

179
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:02,100
Izu Pacific Land

180
00:21:03,900 --> 00:21:05,200
Izu ... .

181
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:31,300
l might be late tonight .

182
00:21:31,500 --> 00:21:34,000
Put your supper in the microwave . Okay ?

183
00:21:34,800 --> 00:21:36,800
- Mom ? - Yeah ?

184
00:21:37,700 --> 00:21:40,300
Tomoko watched the cursed video .

185
00:21:44,100 --> 00:21:45,800
Why would you say that ?

186
00:21:46,800 --> 00:21:49,900
Don 't talk about that at school .

187
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:52,400
I won 't . I 'm going to school now .

188
00:22:10,300 --> 00:22:14,200
Monday , September 13

189
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:24,200
Izu Parkway

190
00:22:28,100 --> 00:22:29,500
This is crazy !

191
00:22:33,800 --> 00:22:36,500
Izu Pacific Land

192
00:24:19,100 --> 00:24:20,700
... enjoy our hot springs ... .

193
00:24:20,800 --> 00:24:23,400
... the instructor will teach you thoroughly ... .

194
00:24:23,800 --> 00:24:26,000
- Wow , this is roomy ! - Yes , it is .

195
00:25:01,500 --> 00:25:06,600
" My dad 's fat . So is my mom . So I 'm fat , too . "

196
00:25:48,900 --> 00:25:50,400
Are you here alone ?

197
00:25:50,700 --> 00:25:53,300
Yeah , I 'm working .

198
00:25:57,400 --> 00:26:00,900
These four people stayed here on August 29 .

199
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:04,600
Did you notice anything unusual ?

200
00:26:05,500 --> 00:26:08,800
Just a minute . August 29 ... .

201
00:26:33,700 --> 00:26:35,000
That tape ... .

202
00:26:36,100 --> 00:26:37,400
That one .

203
00:26:38,400 --> 00:26:39,700
What is it ?

204
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:41,600
This one ?

205
00:26:44,100 --> 00:26:46,000
Someone must have left it .

206
00:27:51,600 --> 00:27:53,000
Eruption

207
00:28:09,100 --> 00:28:11,200
Sada

208
00:29:27,200 --> 00:29:28,400
One week !

209
00:30:10,500 --> 00:30:14,700
Tuesday , September 1 4

210
00:31:05,700 --> 00:31:08,100
is Yoichi in elementary school already ?

211
00:31:09,700 --> 00:31:11,100
First grade .

212
00:31:14,500 --> 00:31:16,200
So how are you , Ryuji ?

213
00:31:17,500 --> 00:31:19,000
The same .

214
00:31:19,900 --> 00:31:21,600
What do you do ?

215
00:31:22,300 --> 00:31:24,200
Teach at a university .

216
00:31:30,600 --> 00:31:32,800
So then there was a phone call ?

217
00:31:33,300 --> 00:31:34,300
Yes .

218
00:31:35,300 --> 00:31:37,900
So this phone will ring after I see it ?

219
00:31:38,200 --> 00:31:40,800
Four people died , all on the same day !

220
00:31:40,900 --> 00:31:43,200
Then get exorcised .

221
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:48,900
Take my picture .

222
00:31:56,400 --> 00:31:57,800
Face this way .

223
00:32:01,300 --> 00:32:03,000
Hurry up and take it !

224
00:33:22,800 --> 00:33:24,000
it 's over .

225
00:33:42,600 --> 00:33:44,000
No phone call .

226
00:33:46,200 --> 00:33:49,200
Copy this for me . I 'll take a good look at it .

227
00:33:50,600 --> 00:33:52,900
You can 't be sure that you 're going to die .

228
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:55,200
it 's a video . Someone made it .

229
00:33:56,600 --> 00:34:00,300
I 'll check who stayed there , and if there were any pirate broadcasts .

230
00:34:05,100 --> 00:34:09,300
Wednesday , September 15

231
00:34:28,000 --> 00:34:29,500
From the Izu bureau .

232
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:30,700
Thanks !

233
00:34:31,200 --> 00:34:33,700
What are you going to do with the cabin registry ?

234
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:37,600
Sorry , but I just need to check something by myself .

235
00:35:30,700 --> 00:35:32,000
Was it you ?

236
00:35:34,700 --> 00:35:36,200
Did you do this ?

237
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:04,900
Sorry I 'm late .

238
00:36:04,900 --> 00:36:06,300
What 's wrong ?

239
00:36:06,900 --> 00:36:08,000
Nothing .

240
00:36:31,600 --> 00:36:33,100
So , do you have any new information ?

241
00:36:33,500 --> 00:36:36,200
No one I phoned brought a tape to the cabin .

242
00:36:36,400 --> 00:36:40,300
And they all sounded normal , not like they 'd make a tape like this .

243
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:42,100
How about pirate stations ?

244
00:36:42,500 --> 00:36:45,900
There 's no record of an illegal broadcast anywhere in Izu .

245
00:36:47,200 --> 00:36:48,700
Here 's the copy .

246
00:37:02,100 --> 00:37:03,400
Asakawa .

247
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:17,500
Have you ever seen this woman ?

248
00:37:25,500 --> 00:37:26,500
No .

249
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:50,000
This shot is strange .

250
00:37:59,700 --> 00:38:03,300
From that angle , the cameraman should be in the mirror .

251
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:05,400
What do you mean ?

252
00:38:08,700 --> 00:38:12,400
I don 't know . You could fix it with special effects , but ... .

253
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:21,100
" Eruption . "

254
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:23,900
Which eruption ?

255
00:38:30,100 --> 00:38:32,700
You can 't read it on a regular home TV .

256
00:38:39,900 --> 00:38:41,200
Come in .

257
00:38:51,500 --> 00:38:53,500
This is Takano . One of my students .

258
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:56,500
Asakawa . My ex-wife .

259
00:38:58,200 --> 00:39:00,200
How do you do ? I 'm Takano .

260
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:02,300
I 'm Asakawa .

261
00:39:06,700 --> 00:39:09,300
The publisher wants your essay .

262
00:39:09,500 --> 00:39:11,500
Why did they tell you that ?

263
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:13,800
Because they couldn 't reach you .

264
00:39:15,100 --> 00:39:17,100
Ask for a week extension .

265
00:39:17,100 --> 00:39:20,100
Me ? Ask them yourself !

266
00:39:20,100 --> 00:39:21,500
Okay , okay .

267
00:40:20,500 --> 00:40:21,700
Not clear enough .

268
00:40:30,700 --> 00:40:32,000
" Sada . "

269
00:40:36,800 --> 00:40:38,800
is Yoichi all right alone ?

270
00:40:39,800 --> 00:40:41,300
He 's used to it .

271
00:40:43,700 --> 00:40:47,500
Whoever made this video left a clue subconsciously .

272
00:40:48,600 --> 00:40:50,600
The person wants to be found out .

273
00:41:02,600 --> 00:41:03,600
Wait .

274
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:21,800
" Frolic in brine , goblins be thine . " it sounded like that .

275
00:42:23,900 --> 00:42:25,200
What does it mean ?

276
00:42:26,200 --> 00:42:27,900
I 'll check tomorrow .

277
00:42:44,700 --> 00:42:47,900
... who says , " You will die in one week . "

278
00:42:48,100 --> 00:42:50,700
They say she appears when you watch late-night shows on TV .

279
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:52,600
And then the phone rings .

280
00:42:52,700 --> 00:42:54,100
Thursday , September 16

281
00:42:54,100 --> 00:42:56,300
Late-night shows on TV ? What channel ?

282
00:42:56,500 --> 00:43:00,300
I heard it was on a local channel down in Izu .

283
00:43:00,400 --> 00:43:03,000
- Izu ? - Yeah .

284
00:43:04,000 --> 00:43:05,200
Hello ?

285
00:43:05,500 --> 00:43:08,200
I found it . Like I thought , it 's a dialect .

286
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:12,100
It 's about brine and goblins .

287
00:43:13,200 --> 00:43:14,900
A dialect ? From where ?

288
00:43:15,200 --> 00:43:18,200
Oshima Island , where there 's a volcano , Mt . Miharayama .

289
00:43:44,800 --> 00:43:46,200
Hello , Yoichi ?

290
00:43:47,700 --> 00:43:49,500
I 'll be late tonight .

291
00:43:50,100 --> 00:43:51,200
Yeah .

292
00:43:51,700 --> 00:43:53,300
Are you okay alone ?

293
00:43:54,300 --> 00:43:55,600
I 'm sorry .

294
00:44:24,000 --> 00:44:27,100
This is it , but it happened a long time ago .

295
00:44:28,600 --> 00:44:31,900
Mt . Miharayama Eruption Alert To Local Residents

296
00:44:32,800 --> 00:44:35,200
Did Local Woman Predict Eruption ?

297
00:44:46,900 --> 00:44:50,300
- What is it ? - Does the paper have a bureau in Oshima ?

298
00:44:50,400 --> 00:44:54,300
- l think there 's a correspondent there . - Get me the number . Tonight .

299
00:44:56,000 --> 00:44:57,000
Why ?

300
00:44:58,300 --> 00:45:00,400
You only have four days left .

301
00:45:01,800 --> 00:45:04,400
I 'll handle it with your correspondent .

302
00:45:06,800 --> 00:45:08,500
Please stay with Yoichi .

303
00:45:32,500 --> 00:45:33,700
Grandpa !

304
00:45:35,200 --> 00:45:36,200
Welcome !

305
00:45:36,200 --> 00:45:37,500
Friday , September 1 7

306
00:45:37,600 --> 00:45:40,500
- Yoichi wants to go fishing with you . - Really ?

307
00:45:40,600 --> 00:45:44,800
- C 'mon , let 's go ! - Let 's get ready and go fishing !

308
00:45:44,900 --> 00:45:45,900
Yeah !

309
00:45:46,300 --> 00:45:48,400
Right there .

310
00:45:48,700 --> 00:45:51,400
- Now that way ! - Grandpa ! You 've got one !

311
00:45:53,100 --> 00:45:54,600
We missed it !

312
00:45:54,800 --> 00:45:57,400
You 're not very good at this !

313
00:45:59,300 --> 00:46:01,900
Okay , let 's try it again .

314
00:46:01,900 --> 00:46:04,100
Let 's fish over here this time .

315
00:46:04,400 --> 00:46:05,700
All right .

316
00:46:13,700 --> 00:46:15,200
You 're home .

317
00:46:36,300 --> 00:46:37,400
Hello ?

318
00:46:37,500 --> 00:46:40,800
The correspondent in Oshima did some research for us .

319
00:46:42,900 --> 00:46:46,500
The woman who predicted the eruption is probably the one in the video .

320
00:46:46,700 --> 00:46:48,900
Her name was Yamamura Shizuko .

321
00:46:49,300 --> 00:46:52,900
She threw herself into the volcano 40 years ago .

322
00:46:55,900 --> 00:46:57,500
What do we do now ?

323
00:46:57,600 --> 00:46:59,500
I 'll go down there .

324
00:47:00,200 --> 00:47:01,900
I 'll go to Oshima tomorrow .

325
00:47:02,900 --> 00:47:06,000
Oshima ? But I only have three days left !

326
00:47:06,100 --> 00:47:09,200
I know . And I have four .

327
00:47:12,200 --> 00:47:13,700
I 'll call later .

328
00:47:29,800 --> 00:47:31,400
What 's wrong ?

329
00:47:33,200 --> 00:47:35,700
Nothing . Just doing my work .

330
00:48:02,400 --> 00:48:03,600
Auntie .

331
00:48:12,200 --> 00:48:13,300
Yoichi ?

332
00:48:57,400 --> 00:49:00,400
Yoichi ! Did you bring this ?

333
00:49:01,000 --> 00:49:03,800
How dare you ? Why ?

334
00:49:03,900 --> 00:49:05,300
Tomoko ... .

335
00:49:08,500 --> 00:49:10,800
Tomoko told me to watch it .

336
00:49:32,400 --> 00:49:33,900
I was careless .

337
00:49:35,300 --> 00:49:37,700
I sensed something when I visited your house .

338
00:49:39,100 --> 00:49:41,200
But I thought it was the video .

339
00:49:41,800 --> 00:49:43,400
it was Tomoko .

340
00:49:44,000 --> 00:49:45,900
She 's not Tomoko anymore .

341
00:49:46,800 --> 00:49:48,900
Can Yoichi see her , too ?

342
00:50:01,000 --> 00:50:03,000
it 's all my fault , isn 't it ?

343
00:50:04,800 --> 00:50:09,700
it should have ended with Tomoko and her friends .

344
00:50:10,900 --> 00:50:12,400
I don 't know .

345
00:50:14,600 --> 00:50:16,700
Where did this story come from ?

346
00:50:18,200 --> 00:50:20,300
Nobody starts these kind of stories .

347
00:50:21,700 --> 00:50:25,000
Whatever people feel anxious about becomes rumor and starts to spread .

348
00:50:25,000 --> 00:50:26,100
Anxious ?

349
00:50:26,100 --> 00:50:30,600
Or people start them , hoping things will turn out like this .

350
00:50:56,000 --> 00:50:57,300
Mr. Hayatsu ?

351
00:50:57,700 --> 00:51:00,900
Hello . Sorry you had to come all the way out here .

352
00:51:01,000 --> 00:51:02,200
This way .

353
00:51:04,000 --> 00:51:08,100
Saturday , September 18

354
00:51:13,000 --> 00:51:18,100
The Yamamuras in Sashikiji used to run a big fishery .

355
00:51:18,500 --> 00:51:21,100
But they sold most of their business .

356
00:51:22,600 --> 00:51:25,300
Shizuko 's cousin is still alive .

357
00:51:25,600 --> 00:51:28,000
His son and daughter-in-law run an inn .

358
00:51:28,100 --> 00:51:30,800
I 've booked you there for tonight .

359
00:51:45,400 --> 00:51:47,900
Why did Yamamura Shizuko commit suicide ?

360
00:51:48,000 --> 00:51:49,900
I heard she went insane .

361
00:51:51,100 --> 00:51:53,900
The papers had written awful things about her .

362
00:52:01,100 --> 00:52:05,100
She became famous all over the island after her prediction of the eruption .

363
00:52:05,100 --> 00:52:07,900
She had strange powers all her life .

364
00:52:08,000 --> 00:52:10,100
She was what they call a seer .

365
00:52:11,100 --> 00:52:16,000
After that , a professor showed up . You 've heard of him. lkuma Heihachiro .

366
00:52:18,100 --> 00:52:19,600
Wasn 't he fired ?

367
00:52:21,000 --> 00:52:24,600
He brought Shizuko to Tokyo and experimented on her .

368
00:52:25,400 --> 00:52:28,200
He was trying to prove the existence of ESP .

369
00:52:29,200 --> 00:52:33,000
The papers praised him , then trashed him .

370
00:52:34,500 --> 00:52:38,100
it was 40 years ago , and the media still does the same thing .

371
00:52:39,300 --> 00:52:41,500
I 've heard this story .

372
00:52:42,700 --> 00:52:46,700
If I 'm not mistaken , didn 't someone die in the experiment ?

373
00:52:51,100 --> 00:52:54,400
Dr. lkuma disappeared after his university fired him .

374
00:52:56,200 --> 00:52:58,100
I doubt he 's still alive .

375
00:52:59,100 --> 00:53:01,300
Even if we found him , what could we do ?

376
00:53:02,600 --> 00:53:04,900
They say Shizuko had a daughter .

377
00:53:21,500 --> 00:53:22,800
Hello ?

378
00:53:26,500 --> 00:53:27,600
Hello .

379
00:53:27,900 --> 00:53:29,000
Welcome .

380
00:53:29,500 --> 00:53:31,200
I 'll leave you here .

381
00:53:34,500 --> 00:53:35,700
Please come in .

382
00:53:39,500 --> 00:53:40,900
How many rooms ?

383
00:53:42,600 --> 00:53:45,200
- Two , please . - Yes , sir .

384
00:53:49,700 --> 00:53:51,000
This way , please .

385
00:53:55,500 --> 00:53:56,600
Sir ?

386
00:54:14,700 --> 00:54:15,900
Please .

387
00:54:18,300 --> 00:54:19,400
Wait !

388
00:54:20,300 --> 00:54:24,000
- Please tell me about Shizuko ! - There 's nothing to say .

389
00:54:24,100 --> 00:54:25,800
What about her daughter ?

390
00:54:32,100 --> 00:54:33,900
She didn 't have a daughter .

391
00:55:05,300 --> 00:55:06,600
Not eating ?

392
00:55:09,400 --> 00:55:10,500
No .

393
00:55:13,800 --> 00:55:17,300
When I die , stay with me .

394
00:55:19,500 --> 00:55:20,800
Cut it out .

395
00:55:21,600 --> 00:55:22,700
Please !

396
00:55:23,900 --> 00:55:27,400
Please ? And try to find a way to save Yoichi !

397
00:55:27,500 --> 00:55:28,600
Stop it !

398
00:55:31,400 --> 00:55:34,000
The girl who was with Tomoko lost her mind , huh ?

399
00:55:34,700 --> 00:55:36,900
I don 't know what 'll happen to me .

400
00:55:37,300 --> 00:55:39,000
You 'll be all right !

401
00:55:43,300 --> 00:55:45,300
Because I 'm not normal ?

402
00:55:48,900 --> 00:55:51,400
Maybe all three of us should just die .

403
00:55:51,900 --> 00:55:55,300
Good idea ! We shouldn 't have had a kid in the first place .

404
00:55:56,000 --> 00:55:57,400
Stop it !

405
00:56:04,900 --> 00:56:06,800
We still have two days left .

406
00:56:08,700 --> 00:56:10,000
Excuse me .

407
00:56:10,800 --> 00:56:12,000
Come in .

408
00:56:16,000 --> 00:56:18,200
Did you want to know about Shizuko ?

409
00:56:22,100 --> 00:56:24,000
This is all that 's left .

410
00:56:29,500 --> 00:56:31,100
is this Dr. lkuma ?

411
00:56:31,300 --> 00:56:34,900
Yes. it was before I came here .

412
00:56:36,000 --> 00:56:37,200
Good night .

413
00:56:37,400 --> 00:56:38,700
Thank you .

414
00:56:44,400 --> 00:56:47,900
Frolic in brine ...

415
00:56:49,700 --> 00:56:52,900
goblins be thine .

416
00:57:03,500 --> 00:57:08,100
Sunday , September 19

417
00:57:26,900 --> 00:57:29,000
You 'd better leave this town .

418
00:57:29,800 --> 00:57:32,000
There 's a storm coming tonight .

419
00:57:34,700 --> 00:57:37,000
What was Shizuko like ?

420
00:57:38,900 --> 00:57:40,700
She was a strange one .

421
00:57:41,900 --> 00:57:44,600
She used to sit here all day long .

422
00:57:46,000 --> 00:57:50,300
She 'd just stare at the sea every single day .

423
00:57:53,000 --> 00:57:55,100
All the fishermen hated her .

424
00:57:57,400 --> 00:58:01,000
The sea is ominous for us .

425
00:58:01,800 --> 00:58:05,400
Every year some of us die in the sea .

426
00:58:08,600 --> 00:58:11,400
But she just kept staring at it- -

427
00:58:11,600 --> 00:58:14,000
" Frolic in brine , goblins be thine . "

428
00:58:16,900 --> 00:58:19,900
If you play in the sea , the goblins come to get you .

429
00:58:22,500 --> 00:58:25,200
Shizuko was able to read people 's minds , wasn 't she ?

430
00:58:26,300 --> 00:58:30,100
She must have known about things which people hid deep inside their minds .

431
00:58:30,900 --> 00:58:32,700
That must have been painful .

432
00:58:32,800 --> 00:58:34,000
Go home !

433
00:58:35,500 --> 00:58:38,200
I have similar abilities .

434
00:58:40,900 --> 00:58:44,900
You were the one who spread a rumor about Shizuko 's abilities , weren 't you ?

435
00:58:45,100 --> 00:58:48,200
- You also called Dr. lkuma . - Nonsense !

436
00:58:48,200 --> 00:58:51,700
You thought you could make money off of Shizuko .

437
00:58:52,700 --> 00:58:55,400
You earned money from the newspapers , too .

438
00:58:55,900 --> 00:58:57,100
That 's enough !

439
00:59:01,100 --> 00:59:03,900
Tell me about her daughter ! What happened to her ?

440
00:59:04,000 --> 00:59:07,000
- l don 't know ! - She should have been with Shizuko !

441
00:59:08,000 --> 00:59:09,700
ESP Public Demonstration

442
00:59:11,200 --> 00:59:12,700
You were there ...

443
00:59:16,900 --> 00:59:19,300
when Shizuko gave her demonstration .

444
00:59:55,100 --> 00:59:56,200
Correct .

445
01:00:03,300 --> 01:00:04,400
Correct .

446
01:00:06,400 --> 01:00:07,500
Correct .

447
01:00:09,900 --> 01:00:11,100
Correct .

448
01:00:12,400 --> 01:00:13,600
Correct .

449
01:00:16,100 --> 01:00:17,800
This is a fraud !

450
01:00:18,100 --> 01:00:21,200
This is just a magic show !

451
01:00:22,000 --> 01:00:23,300
You can 't fool me !

452
01:00:23,300 --> 01:00:25,800
Dr. lkuma , she 's deceiving you , too !

453
01:00:41,600 --> 01:00:43,300
Hey ! What 's wrong ?

454
01:00:47,000 --> 01:00:48,300
He 's dead .

455
01:00:50,100 --> 01:00:51,600
She 's a monster !

456
01:00:57,700 --> 01:00:59,500
Sadako ! Did you do that ?

457
01:01:01,300 --> 01:01:02,400
Sadako ?

458
01:01:04,000 --> 01:01:05,200
Sada

459
01:01:07,100 --> 01:01:08,700
Sadako killed him ?

460
01:01:10,700 --> 01:01:12,900
She could kill someone just by wishing ?

461
01:01:13,000 --> 01:01:16,000
She was a monster !

462
01:01:19,100 --> 01:01:20,300
Sadako !

463
01:01:35,300 --> 01:01:36,400
Hey !

464
01:02:05,800 --> 01:02:11,100
Yes ! After Shizuko killed herself , Dr. lkuma took Sadako with him .

465
01:02:11,800 --> 01:02:14,400
But nobody knows what happened to them since .

466
01:02:15,300 --> 01:02:17,700
Find them !

467
01:02:18,500 --> 01:02:21,800
Dr. lkuma may be dead , but Sadako should be in her 40s .

468
01:02:22,400 --> 01:02:24,400
I 'll explain later . Hurry !

469
01:02:29,200 --> 01:02:31,400
I doubt Sadako is alive , either .

470
01:02:33,200 --> 01:02:36,700
She killed a man just by wishing his death .

471
01:02:38,900 --> 01:02:41,900
Her power was much stronger than her mother 's .

472
01:02:44,000 --> 01:02:45,500
Then that video ... .

473
01:02:47,500 --> 01:02:49,300
it 's not from this world .

474
01:02:53,100 --> 01:02:55,600
it 's Sadako 's wrath .

475
01:03:00,400 --> 01:03:02,300
She 's put a curse on us .

476
01:03:11,800 --> 01:03:15,900
All the ferries have been canceled because the typhoon 's too close .

477
01:03:15,900 --> 01:03:18,100
Try a fishing boat . We 'll pay .

478
01:03:18,200 --> 01:03:19,700
A fishing boat ?

479
01:03:20,600 --> 01:03:23,800
The typhoon might change course . You 'd better wait .

480
01:03:23,900 --> 01:03:26,200
Okay , then I 'll find one !

481
01:03:26,700 --> 01:03:28,100
Mr. Takayama !

482
01:03:28,300 --> 01:03:29,700
Mr. Takayama !

483
01:03:52,900 --> 01:03:54,000
Hello ?

484
01:03:54,300 --> 01:03:58,700
Ms. Asakawa ? I 'm sorry , but there 's no trace of either of them .

485
01:04:00,700 --> 01:04:01,800
Hello ?

486
01:04:01,900 --> 01:04:03,200
Thank you .

487
01:04:14,600 --> 01:04:15,700
Yoichi !

488
01:04:33,800 --> 01:04:34,800
Izu !

489
01:04:45,900 --> 01:04:47,100
Ryuji !

490
01:04:55,600 --> 01:04:56,800
Ryuji .

491
01:04:58,600 --> 01:05:01,000
The phone didn 't ring at my house .

492
01:05:01,200 --> 01:05:03,800
The only place it rang was at that cabin !

493
01:05:04,600 --> 01:05:06,300
Dr. lkuma must 've ... .

494
01:05:07,200 --> 01:05:08,900
But we 're stuck here .

495
01:05:08,900 --> 01:05:12,500
You can 't take a boat out on a night like this !

496
01:05:17,500 --> 01:05:19,000
Let me handle this .

497
01:05:30,200 --> 01:05:32,400
Sadako 's calling you , isn 't she ?

498
01:05:34,200 --> 01:05:39,300
Or maybe she 's planning to drag us into the sea .

499
01:05:51,000 --> 01:05:52,100
Take us !

500
01:06:10,400 --> 01:06:12,300
it 's strange , isn 't it ?

501
01:06:12,900 --> 01:06:14,700
I 'm not afraid at all .

502
01:06:19,300 --> 01:06:23,500
Sadako probably died there , before that cabin was built .

503
01:06:25,200 --> 01:06:28,000
Was Sadako Dr. lkuma 's daughter ?

504
01:06:29,600 --> 01:06:31,900
He had a wife and family .

505
01:06:32,000 --> 01:06:34,300
His affair with Shizuko caused a scandal .

506
01:06:34,400 --> 01:06:36,800
That was another reason for his dismissal .

507
01:06:39,100 --> 01:06:41,000
Let 's find Sadako 's corpse .

508
01:06:42,300 --> 01:06:45,400
Will that lift the curse ? Will that save Yoichi ?

509
01:06:46,700 --> 01:06:48,400
There 's nothing else we can do .

510
01:06:53,900 --> 01:06:55,500
I have one day left .

511
01:07:22,900 --> 01:07:25,200
I guess Sadako doesn 't hate you .

512
01:07:31,100 --> 01:07:33,400
Shizuko used to talk to the sea .

513
01:07:34,100 --> 01:07:38,100
She mumbled things to it . She looked like she was having fun .

514
01:07:40,600 --> 01:07:43,300
I hid once and listened .

515
01:07:46,900 --> 01:07:49,100
But it wasn 't a human language .

516
01:07:59,800 --> 01:08:04,100
Monday , September 20

517
01:08:12,700 --> 01:08:13,900
Hello ?

518
01:08:14,000 --> 01:08:15,100
Yoichi ?

519
01:08:17,100 --> 01:08:19,700
it 's Mom . I 'm coming back tomorrow .

520
01:08:19,700 --> 01:08:22,800
I 'm bored here . I want to go back to school !

521
01:08:25,700 --> 01:08:28,600
Don 't say that ! You 'll hurt Grandpa 's feelings !

522
01:08:29,300 --> 01:08:32,100
He 's laughing . Do you want to talk to him ?

523
01:08:33,700 --> 01:08:35,000
That 's okay .

524
01:08:39,200 --> 01:08:40,500
I 'm sorry .

525
01:08:42,500 --> 01:08:44,100
I 'll hurry home .

526
01:08:46,900 --> 01:08:48,300
What 's wrong ?

527
01:08:51,300 --> 01:08:54,200
I still have something to do .

528
01:08:56,500 --> 01:09:00,200
Say hello to Grandpa for me .

529
01:09:19,900 --> 01:09:22,000
What time did you watch the video ?

530
01:09:22,100 --> 01:09:25,800
it was 7 or 8 minutes after 7 : 00 p.m. , but it was before 7 : 10 for sure .

531
01:09:26,100 --> 01:09:28,500
If the story 's true , that will be your deadline .

532
01:10:08,800 --> 01:10:09,800
Here .

533
01:11:30,600 --> 01:11:33,200
- A well , just as I thought ! - A well ?

534
01:12:21,800 --> 01:12:23,100
Her father ?

535
01:12:26,800 --> 01:12:30,800
Dr. lkuma put this lid on . Sadako 's under here .

536
01:13:18,700 --> 01:13:20,100
I 'll go down .

537
01:14:01,500 --> 01:14:03,400
Sadako was still alive !

538
01:14:04,900 --> 01:14:06,800
She tried to climb up .

539
01:14:31,200 --> 01:14:32,700
Lower the buckets !

540
01:14:54,200 --> 01:14:55,500
Pull it up !

541
01:15:27,100 --> 01:15:28,400
Pull it up !

542
01:15:51,200 --> 01:15:52,500
Pull it up !

543
01:16:34,000 --> 01:16:35,700
it 's 6 : 00 p.m. already !

544
01:16:37,800 --> 01:16:40,000
I know ! Hurry and take it up !

545
01:17:04,000 --> 01:17:05,300
Pull it up !

546
01:17:09,200 --> 01:17:10,500
Asakawa !

547
01:17:38,500 --> 01:17:41,000
Damn it ! Are you trying to kill me ?

548
01:17:43,000 --> 01:17:44,100
Hey !

549
01:17:55,300 --> 01:17:56,500
Asakawa !

550
01:18:11,200 --> 01:18:12,600
Let 's switch .

551
01:18:14,000 --> 01:18:15,800
You can 't lift anymore .

552
01:18:17,900 --> 01:18:18,900
No !

553
01:18:20,500 --> 01:18:23,000
Then who 's going to lift the buckets up ?

554
01:18:23,400 --> 01:18:25,800
We don 't even know if it 'll save us !

555
01:18:27,400 --> 01:18:29,400
Then what about Yoichi ?

556
01:18:30,300 --> 01:18:32,400
You have to pick him up tomorrow !

557
01:18:53,000 --> 01:18:54,500
Don 't look down !

558
01:19:16,800 --> 01:19:18,300
Where are you ?

559
01:19:19,000 --> 01:19:20,200
Come out !

560
01:19:51,600 --> 01:19:54,700
Please ! Where are you ?

561
01:20:51,600 --> 01:20:52,800
it 's you .

562
01:21:22,500 --> 01:21:27,700
Hey ! Asakawa ! it 's past 7 : 10 !

563
01:21:28,900 --> 01:21:30,200
We 're saved !

564
01:21:50,300 --> 01:21:55,600
Why did he kill his own daughter ?

565
01:21:57,400 --> 01:21:59,500
Maybe she wasn 't his daughter .

566
01:22:04,200 --> 01:22:08,800
I wonder if her father was even human .

567
01:22:16,100 --> 01:22:17,700
The marks are gone .

568
01:22:20,100 --> 01:22:21,400
it 's over .

569
01:22:23,700 --> 01:22:25,400
I 'll take you home .

570
01:23:16,400 --> 01:23:20,500
Get some rest . I 've got a deadline for my essay .

571
01:23:25,500 --> 01:23:26,800
Thank you .

572
01:24:30,700 --> 01:24:31,800
Idiot !

573
01:25:03,600 --> 01:25:07,600
Tuesday , September 21

574
01:26:10,500 --> 01:26:11,500
Why ?

575
01:26:23,400 --> 01:26:26,800
Now I got it ! Asakawa !

576
01:28:11,200 --> 01:28:12,900
Are you a resident ?

577
01:28:13,200 --> 01:28:14,700
I 'm Takayama Ryuji 's wife !

578
01:28:14,800 --> 01:28:17,100
The body 's been taken away , ma 'am .

579
01:28:27,000 --> 01:28:28,400
What happened ?

580
01:28:30,600 --> 01:28:33,400
When I got there , he was lying on the floor .

581
01:28:33,800 --> 01:28:37,100
Did he say anything to you ? About a video ?

582
01:28:42,100 --> 01:28:43,600
His face ... .

583
01:28:57,900 --> 01:28:59,500
Why , Ryuji ?

584
01:29:01,100 --> 01:29:02,900
Will Yoichi die , too ?

585
01:29:03,700 --> 01:29:05,600
Didn 't we lift the curse ?

586
01:29:06,800 --> 01:29:08,900
Why was I the only one saved ?

587
01:30:09,000 --> 01:30:11,600
Sadako 's curse was only lifted from me .

588
01:30:13,200 --> 01:30:15,000
Why not you , Ryuji ?

589
01:30:17,900 --> 01:30:20,100
What did I do that you didn 't ?

590
01:30:22,300 --> 01:30:24,400
What did I do that you didn 't ?

591
01:30:42,000 --> 01:30:43,100
Ryuji ?

592
01:31:04,000 --> 01:31:06,300
Something I did that you didn 't ...

593
01:31:08,000 --> 01:31:09,700
to lift the curse .

594
01:31:18,500 --> 01:31:19,900
I copied it ...

595
01:31:21,000 --> 01:31:22,700
and showed it to you !

596
01:31:42,100 --> 01:31:45,600
Dad ? Yeah , I 'm on my way .

597
01:31:47,500 --> 01:31:51,600
I have a favor to ask you. it 's for Yoichi .

598
01:31:55,700 --> 01:31:59,300
I heard that there 's a way to lift the curse from the video .

599
01:32:00,000 --> 01:32:03,200
You have to copy it and show it to someone else within a week .

600
01:32:03,300 --> 01:32:05,500
Then what happens to them ?

601
01:32:05,700 --> 01:32:08,600
They have to do the same thing within a week .

602
01:32:08,600 --> 01:32:10,400
Then it never ends ?

603
01:32:10,400 --> 01:32:12,600
That 's right . It goes on forever .

604
01:32:12,700 --> 01:32:16,700
But if you don 't want to die , you 'd do it , wouldn 't you ?

605
01:32:29,900 --> 01:32:35,200
Wednesday , September 22

